	quest.0596B8C109ADC6D1.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.059E9E819EE18BA2.quest_desc: ["应用升级而不更改过滤设置会将所有检测到的物品都拉到玩家身边。"]
	quest.059E9E819EE18BA2.quest_subtitle: "在5格半径内将附近的物品拉到玩家身边"
	quest.05BC7CBC05B15830.quest_subtitle: "将热量推送到一个小区域，注意不要泵入过多热量。"
	quest.05BFBACBB2337231.quest_subtitle: "安山岩是一种非常丰富的石头，你可以在地下的大块区域找到，而且它和石头的纹理很搭，所以多留意一下。如果你要在这里制造机器，就需要大量的这种石头，所以尽可能多地挖掘吧！另外，锌矿石也很重要，因为它和安山岩混合后能制成制造机器所需的合金。"
	quest.05BFBACBB2337231.title: "安山岩，基石"
	quest.05D04965151FFD7E.quest_subtitle: "向装置传输和接收能量。"
	quest.05E7258844F3F600.quest_subtitle: "赋予再生效果"
	quest.062F228BCAE231E6.quest_subtitle: "当过滤器槽位中使用包裹过滤器时，黄铜隧道或智能滑道等创造组件将根据包裹是否与过滤器中的地址匹配来对纸板包裹进行分类。"
	quest.063D47D4F61457BC.quest_subtitle: "让你可以安排列车，让生物或烈焰人焚化炉来驾驶它们。"
	quest.065BDCEBC8F29507.quest_desc: ["&b镰刀&r是一种&6武器&r，用于从&a墓碑中复活死去的村民&r。要复活村民，&a用镰刀杀死另一个村民，然后点击该村民的墓碑&r。复活后，该村民会&e以僵尸村民的形式复活&r。"]
	quest.065BDCEBC8F29507.quest_subtitle: "通过击杀死神（Grim Reaper）获得。"
	quest.06653E21053ACDF6.quest_subtitle: "一种红石元件，当一侧接收到红石信号时开启，当另一侧接收到信号时关闭。"
	quest.068BF02B99DABEBD.title: "&a合成： &f机械之眼"
	quest.06BC3C3C934CD81B.quest_desc: ["Using mods like &eNumatics, &eCustom Villager Trades, &eMCA Reborn, and &eXero's Claimable Chunks,&r we created a fully integrated &6economy system. With &bCTV Villager Trades,&r we overhauled the vanilla villager trading system, adding tons of custom trades. &eCreate Numatics establishes a stable currency system that works seamlessly in multiplayer worlds, allowing players to set up shops, banks, and other essential economic features. In multiplayer, instead of starting with a fixed number of claimable chunks, players must exchange coins to claim more chunks. Currency can also help you acquire resources that your island may lack and support your automation and adventure endeavors."]
	quest.06BC3C3C934CD81B.title: "&l&6经济系统"
	quest.0709E8AE808EE9DF.quest_subtitle: "召唤出 Karkinos 生物"
	quest.0729E0E98B1F4B93.title: "&e访问：&a主世界"
