	quest.5648704451A2204E.quest_desc: ["[空格] 起飞，[shift] 减速，按住 [r] 可跳伞"]
	quest.5648704451A2204E.quest_subtitle: "比原版更庞大的货运空中飞船！"
	quest.564D7B09CC3E2F35.quest_desc: ["&bRose Gold Ingots&r are &6gold-alternative&r, meaning they can be used to create gold items such as clock, gold blocks and etc. &bRose Gold Ingot's&r &6main feature&r, is that they are more cheaper. From 3 gold and 1 copper player can get 4 Rose Gold Ingots, meaning player can get &a33% more Rose Gold Ingots than regular Gold Ingots&r."]
	quest.5671A401F786D198.quest_subtitle: "风车帆是一种用于制作风车的方块。"
