	quest.61EBDA6BB79D8D57.quest_desc: ["&6This modpack offers a great &aadventure experience&r, featuring mods like &fSimply Swords, Bosses of Mass Destruction, Immersive Airplanes, and Small Ships&r. With the help of &bFTB Quests&r and the fully integrated &6economy system&r, players can sell rare loot and complete an array of tasks and objectives, all designed to enhance their journey while benefiting from it. Players must rely on &aautomation&r and the economy system to obtain advanced travel equipment and powerful vehicles, like airplanes and rocket ships, essential for navigating and conquering the seas and space."]
